<title>JAPAN: Daiki Engineering - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Daiki Engineering - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  3.02		vs	    2.97</p>
<p> Operating	   57    mln	  vs	  133    mln</p>
